      "worked_solution": "From the graph, we see that it is not possible to approach $x=-3$ from the left. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\,-{3}^{-}}f(x)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, when we approach $x=-3$ from the right, we have\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\,-{3}^{+}}f(x)=2.\n$$\n\nSince ${lim}_{x\\to \\,-{3}^{-}}f(x)\\ne {lim}_{x\\to \\,-{3}^{+}}f(x),$ we  conclude  that\n \n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\,-3}f(x)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$",
